  "description": "Yubi is a simple guy, who likes ramen and lives his life. One day he wakes up and finds a strange girl with a bowl of rice on her head in his house. Not understanding who she is, or where she came from, he asks her to leave. After, he finds that she was sitting near his door. She explains to him, that she is a fairy and is ready to take care of him, as his father was the King of Fairies. Yubi is shocked, but allows Lissie to stay. \n\n(Source: Coolmic)",
